    ///   `Micros(0)` makes one attempt and returns.
    ///   [`Micros::FOREVER`] never gives up.
    /// - `fill`: called once with a mutable reference to the claimed
    ///   slot's message, to write the message in place. Not called
    ///   when the send returns `Err(Full)`.
    ///
    /// # Type parameters
    ///
